  70:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_spi.c ****             (+) TxRxHalfCpltCallback  : SPI TxRx Half Completed callback
  71:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_spi.c ****             (+) ErrorCallback         : SPI Error callback
